@host = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### 建立 Table 與初始 Fields
# @name createTable
POST {{host}}/api/tables
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "專案追蹤",
  "fields": [
    {
      "fieldKey": "name",
      "label": "專案名稱",
      "type": "text",
      "required": true,
      "maxLength": 100
    },
    {
      "fieldKey": "score",
      "label": "分數",
      "type": "number",
      "required": false,
      "numberMode": "integer",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100
    },
    {
      "fieldKey": "due_date",
      "label": "到期日",
      "type": "date",
      "required": false
    },
    {
      "fieldKey": "status",
      "label": "狀態",
      "type": "singleSelect",
      "required": true,
      "options": [
        { "value": "active", "label": "進行中", "isActive": true },
        { "value": "done", "label": "已完成", "isActive": true }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

### 請將 createTable 回應中的 id 貼到這裡
@tableId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 新增 Record
POST {{host}}/api/tables/{{tableId}}/records
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": {
    "name": "TableMint MVP",
    "score": 95,
    "due_date": "2026-12-31",
    "status": "active"
  }
}

### 分頁、排序及型態化篩選
GET {{host}}/api/tables/{{tableId}}/records?page=1&pageSize=20&sortBy=createdAt&sortDirection=descending&filterField=score&filterValue=95

### Swagger UI
GET {{host}}/swagger
